; Arrivals.nani — LLEGADA: @sfx (megafonía) + Yuina felicita.
; Las líneas usan @print con printer:YuinaPrinter FORZADO, para que vayan al
; printer pequeño aunque el Linked Printer de Yuina sea YuinaIntroPrinter.

# Station01
@char Yuina.Announce scale:0.5
@sfx arr_kumamoto wait:false volume:0.5
@showPrinter YuinaPrinter
@printer YuinaPrinter
@print "First stop! See? The train really does move when you put the hours in. No turning back now." printer:YuinaPrinter author:Yuina !waitInput
@stop

# Station02
@char Yuina.Announce scale:0.5
@sfx arr_hakata wait:false volume:0.5
@showPrinter YuinaPrinter
@printer YuinaPrinter
@print "Fukuoka already? You're sticking with this better than most people do. I'm a little impressed." printer:YuinaPrinter author:Yuina !waitInput
@stop

# Station03
@char Yuina.Announce scale:0.5
@sfx arr_yamaguti wait:false volume:0.5
@showPrinter YuinaPrinter
@printer YuinaPrinter
@print "Fifty hours in. Honestly? I figured you'd have wandered off by now. Glad you proved me wrong." printer:YuinaPrinter author:Yuina !waitInput
@stop

# Station04
@char Yuina.Announce scale:0.5
@sfx arr_hirosima wait:false volume:0.5
@showPrinter YuinaPrinter
@printer YuinaPrinter
@print "Hiroshima. You're starting to get a feel for the rhythm of this, aren't you? Keep that momentum." printer:YuinaPrinter author:Yuina !waitInput
@stop

# Station05
@char Yuina.Announce scale:0.5
@sfx arr_takamatu wait:false volume:0.5
@showPrinter YuinaPrinter
@printer YuinaPrinter
@print "Things get a little steeper from here. But don't worry — I'm riding right alongside you." printer:YuinaPrinter author:Yuina !waitInput
@stop

# Station06
@char Yuina.Announce scale:0.5
@sfx arr_oosaka wait:false volume:0.5
@showPrinter YuinaPrinter
@printer YuinaPrinter
@print "Two hundred hours. I shouldn't underestimate anyone who makes it this far. You've earned this stop." printer:YuinaPrinter author:Yuina !waitInput
@stop

# Station07
@char Yuina.Announce scale:0.5
@sfx arr_tokyo wait:false volume:0.5
@showPrinter YuinaPrinter
@printer YuinaPrinter
@print "Tokyo — the liveliest station on the line. Your Japanese is getting livelier too, you know." printer:YuinaPrinter author:Yuina !waitInput
@stop

# Station08
@char Yuina.Announce scale:0.5
@sfx arr_ooarai wait:false volume:0.5
@showPrinter YuinaPrinter
@printer YuinaPrinter
@print "By now this isn't really studying anymore, is it? It's just part of your days. I love that." printer:YuinaPrinter author:Yuina !waitInput
@stop

# Station09
@char Yuina.Announce scale:0.5
@sfx arr_fukusima wait:false volume:0.5
@showPrinter YuinaPrinter
@printer YuinaPrinter
@print "I'll be honest with you. Not many people make it this far without giving up. You're something else." printer:YuinaPrinter author:Yuina !waitInput
@stop

# Station10
@char Yuina.Announce scale:0.5
@sfx arr_sendai wait:false volume:0.5
@showPrinter YuinaPrinter
@printer YuinaPrinter
@print "Eight hundred hours. The number alone is dizzying... but you got here one step at a time, didn't you?" printer:YuinaPrinter author:Yuina !waitInput
@stop

# Station11
@char Yuina.Announce scale:0.5
@sfx arr_tugaru wait:false volume:0.5
@showPrinter YuinaPrinter
@printer YuinaPrinter
@print "A thousand hours. We crossed that line together. I'm feeling a little sentimental, honestly." printer:YuinaPrinter author:Yuina !waitInput
@stop

# Station12
@char Yuina.Announce scale:0.5
@sfx arr_hakodate wait:false volume:0.5
@showPrinter YuinaPrinter
@printer YuinaPrinter
@print "Lately your Japanese has this... ease to it. Less thinking before speaking. It makes me happy." printer:YuinaPrinter author:Yuina !waitInput
@stop

# Station13
@char Yuina.Announce scale:0.5
@sfx arr_sapporo wait:false volume:0.5
@showPrinter YuinaPrinter
@printer YuinaPrinter
@print "Not much track left now. Part of me will miss this — but that's just proof of how far you've come." printer:YuinaPrinter author:Yuina !waitInput
@stop

# Station14
@char Yuina.Announce scale:0.5
@sfx arr_wakkanai wait:false volume:0.5
@showPrinter YuinaPrinter
@printer YuinaPrinter
@print "Wakkanai. The final stop. ...I didn't think we'd actually make it, back at the start. I'm so glad we traveled this together. Thank you." printer:YuinaPrinter author:Yuina !waitInput
@stop

# End
@stop
